Z||000027||stimpy||06-30-2001||10:05 PM||||Hey Eric, time to back up and take stock. Archie is not your copetition, so I can't figure out why you would want to insinuate that he is less then professional. If I was only going to look at how photogenic a shop was to decide if I was going to invest my bucks in their product and services, I'm afraid West Coast Fieros is far from a gleaming 30,000 sq ft high tech environment. This just smacks of pots calling kettles black.<P>I respect what Archie has done and is continuig to do for the Fiero community, and I also respect the technological advances and workmanship that your dad's shop offers. I think cheapening Archie's rep only serves to make WCF's rep suffer. You don't need to go there. ||||reg||1
